## Relationships

### Semantic

- [CXC-FPBUS-REQ-PUSH-NEEDED-HEARTBEAT] USES [CXC-FPBUS-MSG-FINGERPRINT-PUSH-NEEDED]
- [CXC-FPBUS-REQ-INOPERABLE-HEARTBEAT] USES [CXC-FPBUS-MSG-FINGERPRINT-INOPERABLE]
- [CXC-FPBUS-REQ-READY-HEARTBEAT] USES [CXC-FPBUS-MSG-FINGERPRINT-READY]
- [CXC-FPBUS-REQ-UUID-MATCH-BRANCH] USES [CXC-FPBUS-MSG-TEMPLATE-SET-LOADED]
- [CXC-FPBUS-REQ-UUID-MISMATCH-BRANCH] USES [CXC-FPBUS-MSG-TEMPLATE-SET-LOADED]
- [CXC-FPBUS-REQ-LOAD-FAILURE] USES [CXC-FPBUS-MSG-TEMPLATE-SET-FAILED]
- [CXC-FPBUS-REQ-DELETE-FAILURE-ESCALATION] USES [CXC-FPBUS-MSG-FINGERPRINT-PUSH-NEEDED]
